    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Marcel found Anthony, an abused runaway dying of AIDS, sleeping in a French Quarter alley and Embraced him rather than let him die by inches. Gaunt and unusually plain beside Marcel's other childe Christopher, Anthony has more than compensated with total devotion to his sire, effectively running the city and its spy network whenever Marcel's business calls him away. Anthony sees himself as the rightful next Prince of New Orleans and owes his own unlife (and Marie D'Richet's) to the very rival, Christopher, he most wishes to eclipse.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You imitate your sire's style and grace in everything you do, and quietly relish the influence you hold as his de facto lieutenant.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 2, Dominate 2, Fortitude 1, Presence 2.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Marcel Guilbeau. Feeds only upon those he believes have made themselves victims. Haven: Marcel's home. Secrets rating: B+.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
